# GraphPlot

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphPlot } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphPlot
  title="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `data` | `number[]` | `—` | — |
| `labels?` | `string[]` | `—` | — |
| `height?` | `number` | `7` | — |
| `variant?` | `'line' | 'area'` | `'area'` | — |
| `progress?` | `number` | `1` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphPlotProps`
